#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:10
msgid "Connected to Reviewbird"
msgstr "Ühendatud Reviewbirdiga"

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:11
msgid ""
"Your WooCommerce store is successfully connected to Reviewbird. Review data "
"is syncing properly."
msgstr ""
"Teie WooCommerce pood on edukalt ühendatud Reviewbirdiga. Arvustuste andmed "
"sünkroonitakse korralikult."

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:12
msgid "View Dashboard"
msgstr "Vaata armatuurlauda"

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:18
msgid "WooCommerce Not Connected"
msgstr "WooCommerce ei ole ühendatud"

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:19
msgid ""
"WooCommerce is not yet connected to Reviewbird. Connect your store to start "
"syncing products and reviews."
msgstr ""
"WooCommerce ei ole veel ühendatud Reviewbirdiga. Ühendage oma pood, et "
"alustada toodete ja arvustuste sünkroonimist."

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:20
msgid "Connect WooCommerce"
msgstr "Ühenda WooCommerce"

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:26
msgid "Initial Sync in Progress"
msgstr "Esialgne sünkroonimine käib"

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:27
msgid ""
"Reviewbird is syncing your products and reviews. This may take a few minutes "
"depending on your catalog size. The widget will be available once sync "
"completes."
msgstr ""
"Reviewbird sünkroonib teie tooteid ja arvustusi. See võib võtta paar "
"minutit, sõltuvalt teie kataloogi suurusest. Vidin on saadaval pärast "
"sünkroonimise lõppu."

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:28
msgid "View Sync Progress"
msgstr "Vaata sünkroonimise edenemist"

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:34
msgid "Subscription Required"
msgstr "Tellimus vajalik"

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:35
msgid ""
"Your Reviewbird subscription is inactive. Please update your billing "
"information to continue using the service."
msgstr ""
"Teie Reviewbirdi tellimus on inaktiivne. Palun uuendage oma arveldusteavet, "
"et teenust jätkata."

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:36
msgid "Update Billing"
msgstr "Uuenda arveldust"

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:42
#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:50
msgid "Connection Issue Detected"
msgstr "Ühenduse probleem tuvastatud"

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:43
msgid "Unable to connect to Reviewbird. Please check your connection settings."
msgstr ""
"Ühendamine Reviewbirdiga ebaõnnestus. Palun kontrollige oma ühenduse seadeid."

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:44
msgid "Fix Connection"
msgstr "Paranda ühendus"

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:51
msgid "Unable to reach Reviewbird API. Please check your internet connection."
msgstr ""
"Reviewbirdi API-le ei saa ühendust. Palun kontrollige oma internetiühendust."

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:52
msgid "Get Help"
msgstr "Saada abi"

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:58
msgid "Checking connection..."
msgstr "Ühenduse kontrollimine..."

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:59
msgid "Verifying connection to Reviewbird..."
msgstr "Ühenduse kinnitamine Reviewbirdiga..."

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:60
msgid "Open Reviewbird"
msgstr "Ava Reviewbird"

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:191
msgid "Connection Issue"
msgstr "Ühenduse probleem"

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:260
msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "Värskenda"

#: assets/src/js/components/ConnectionHealth.jsx:281
msgid "Last checked:"
msgstr "Viimati kontrollitud:"

#: assets/src/js/components/LoadingSpinner.jsx:8
msgid "Loading..."
msgstr "Laadimine..."

#: assets/src/js/components/SettingsApp.jsx:44
msgid "Failed to update setting. Please try again."
msgstr "Seadistuse uuendamine ebaõnnestus. Palun proovige uuesti."

#: assets/src/js/components/SettingsApp.jsx:88
msgid "Connected Store Settings"
msgstr "Ühendatud poe seaded"

#: assets/src/js/components/SettingsApp.jsx:94
msgid "Manage your Reviewbird integration with WooCommerce."
msgstr "Haldage oma Reviewbirdi integratsiooni WooCommerce'iga."

#: assets/src/js/components/SettingsApp.jsx:111
msgid "Reviewbird Widget"
msgstr "Reviewbirdi vidin"

#: assets/src/js/components/SettingsApp.jsx:112
msgid ""
"Display Reviewbird review widget on product pages. The widget shows customer "
"reviews and allows customers to submit new reviews."
msgstr ""
"Kuvage Reviewbirdi arvustuste vidin tootepaanidel. Vidin näitab klientide "
"arvustusi ja võimaldab klientidel esitada uusi arvustusi."

#: assets/src/js/components/SettingsApp.jsx:118
msgid "Widget is enabled on all WooCommerce product pages."
msgstr "Vidin on lubatud kõigil WooCommerce'i tootepaanidel."

#: assets/src/js/components/SettingsApp.jsx:127
msgid "Forcefully enable reviews on all products"
msgstr "Sundige arvustused lubama kõigil toodetel"

#: assets/src/js/components/SettingsApp.jsx:133
msgid ""
"Leave this off if you prefer to control reviews per product using the "
"\"Enable reviews\" checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Jätke see välja lülitatuks, kui soovite arvustusi kontrollida toote kaupa, "
"kasutades märkeruutu \"Luba arvustused\"."

#: assets/src/js/components/SettingsApp.jsx:169
msgid "SEO Schema Markup"
msgstr "SEO skeemi märgendus"

#: assets/src/js/components/SettingsApp.jsx:170
msgid ""
"Enable Google-compliant structured data (JSON-LD schema) on product pages "
"for rich snippets in search results."
msgstr ""
"Lülitage tootepaanidel sisse Google'i nõuetele vastav struktureeritud "
"andmete (JSON-LD skeemi) tugi rikkalike väljavõtete jaoks otsingutulemustes."

#: assets/src/js/components/SettingsApp.jsx:176
msgid "Schema markup is active on all WooCommerce product pages."
msgstr "Skeemi märgendus on aktiivne kõigil WooCommerce'i tootepaanidel."

#: assets/src/js/components/SettingsApp.jsx:181
msgid "What is Schema Markup?"
msgstr "Mis on skeemi märgendus?"

#: assets/src/js/components/SettingsApp.jsx:183
msgid "Displays star ratings in Google search results"
msgstr "Kuvab Google'i otsingutulemustes tärnihinnanguid"

#: assets/src/js/components/SettingsApp.jsx:187
msgid "Shows review counts and product information"
msgstr "Näitab arvustuste arvu ja tooteinfot"

#: assets/src/js/components/SettingsApp.jsx:191
msgid "Review schema is cached for 4 hours for optimal performance"
msgstr ""
"Arvustuste skeem on optimaalsete jõudluse tagamiseks vahemällu salvestatud 4 "
"tunniks"

#: assets/src/js/components/SettingsApp.jsx:200
msgid "Test with Google Rich Results"
msgstr "Testi Google Rich Results abil"

#: assets/src/js/components/SettingsApp.jsx:207
msgid "Validate Schema"
msgstr "Valideeri skeem"

